! --- Basic Dark Theme ---
XTerm*background: black
XTerm*foreground: white
XTerm*cursorColor: cyan

! 设置英文字体（核心字体）
XTerm*faceName: DejaVu Sans Mono:style=Book
XTerm*faceSize: 12

! 设置中文字体（双倍宽度字体）
XTerm*faceNameDoublesize: WenQuanYi Micro Hei

! 解决字符间距可能过宽或重叠的问题（可选优化）
XTerm*scaleHeight: 1.0

! --- Optional: Solarized Dark Palette ---
XTerm*color0:  #073642
XTerm*color8:  #002b36
XTerm*color1:  #dc322f
XTerm*color9:  #cb4b16
XTerm*color2:  #859900
XTerm*color10: #586e75
XTerm*color3:  #b58900
XTerm*color11: #657b83
XTerm*color4:  #268bd2
XTerm*color12: #839496
XTerm*color5:  #d33682
XTerm*color13: #6c71c4
XTerm*color6:  #2aa198
XTerm*color14: #93a1a1
XTerm*color7:  #eee8d5
XTerm*color15: #fdf6e3

